Grammar

Rule 0     S' -> sentencia
Rule 1     sentencia -> ID ASIGNA NUM
Rule 2     sentencia -> IF ID THEN sentencia ENDIF
Rule 3     sentencia -> IF ID THEN sentencia ELSE sentencia ENDIF

Terminals, with rules where they appear

ASIGNA               : 1
ELSE                 : 3
ENDIF                : 2 3
ID                   : 1 2 3
IF                   : 2 3
NUM                  : 1
THEN                 : 2 3
error                : 

Nonterminals, with rules where they appear

sentencia            : 2 3 3 0

